# Applies to every image built with the repo root as context
# (all three Dockerfiles under apps/*). Keeps images small and,
# critically, keeps local secrets and artefacts out of the build context.
.git
.github
.vscode
.claude
.turbo
**/.turbo
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.log
docs
infra
docker-compose*.yml
README.md
**/README.md

# Secrets never enter a build context. .env.example files stay available.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
